<title>BELGIUM: Belgolux trade surplus grows in March.</title>
<headline>Belgolux trade surplus grows in March.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Office released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union (in billions of francs) -</p>
<p>    BELGOLUX TRADE		   March     Feb	 March 1996</p>
<p>    Exports			    497.8     467.2     457.8</p>
<p>    Imports			    465.5     447.5     440.5</p>
<p>    Balance			     32.3	19.7	17.3</p>
<p>					Jan-March 97	  Jan-March 96</p>
<p>    Exports (cumulative)	 1,424.3		 1,311.6</p>
<p>    Imports (cumulative)	 1,339.4		 1,249.4</p>
<p>    Balance			     84.8		    62.2</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
